{"seq":3,"slug":"later-life","title":"晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"return-to-mit","title":"重返麻省理工","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life/return-to-mit","wordCount":1473,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-playful-mind","title":"爱玩的头脑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life/a-playful-mind","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 晚年\n\n本章讲述香农的晚年。香农，重返麻省理工担任教授，继续从事研究与教学；他更拥有一颗爱玩的头脑，发明了独轮车、机械鼠等种种奇妙的装置。两篇文档，分别呈现重返麻省理工，以及爱玩的头脑。\n"}